        <p>Understanding the realistic timeline helps you plan and manage expectations. The citizenship journey is not quick, but it is predictable if you know what to expect.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>Pre-Application Phase (4–8 Months)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Month 1–2:</strong> Confirm eligibility and plan your application strategy.</li>
        <li><strong>Month 2–5:</strong> Study and sit DELE A2 exam (allow 4–6 weeks prep).</li>
